{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このジャケット新しいの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん着ようと～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張メッセで\nハルジオンが咲く頃の\n個別握手会がありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から4部まで\n本当にたくさんの方が会いに来てくださり\nすごく嬉しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1日\nあっという間に感じました！\n楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身が楽しみすぎて\nうかうかしてて\n会話になってないーー！！\nなーんてこともあったかもしれませんが。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。\nもうちょっと落ち着いて握手会します。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな、今日は\n1部から4部まで\n髪型やお洋服を変えて\nいろいろな私を見てもらえたと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいお洋服もあるけど\n去年買った、どうやって着ようか迷っていて着られなかったお洋服も\n今年買ったアイテムと合わせたりとかして\n皆さんの前で着られることができて\nよかった～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は寝巻き！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO5の時のノギルームで\n着た寝巻きです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身写真は真っ暗だったから\n明るくしようと思って編集したら\nなんか不気味に！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、まあいいか♪\n許してください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、、ね？\n不気味。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は\n血まみれ星人風の髪型！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"血まみれ星人とは\nじょしらく弍ででてきた\n登場人物です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(きぐちゃん役がやってました！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ででん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと切れてるけど！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！横っちょについてる\nピン留めがこの間皆さんに行った\nイヤリングじゃなくてかわりに買った\nピン留めです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部は、メンズ物のお洋服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミリタリー系のシャツにズボン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型のアップ写真はないんだけど\n横気をねじってとめました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインの大人バージョンってかんじ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3、4部はまた違う私服を着たんですが\n今日はもう写真の枚数限度なので\nまたあした載せます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。中途半端で。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナセレがたまりすぎて\nヒナセレだけのブログが\nながーくなってしまいましたが\n昨日までのブログのヒナセレは\nまとめ終わったので\n随時載せていきたいとおもいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、しかし！今日ではないです。。。すみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のブログと一緒になって\nワチャワチャーとなると\n読みづらくなっちゃうので。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は23時～23時30分まで\nみさ先輩とレコメンに\nゲスト出演します！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん！！！きいてくたざいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ！久しぶり！楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/29/3203814/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐでのぎえいごの時間だ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎえいご見てから寝ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、みなさんおやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}